---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');

---

<Layout
  title="About - Savelle Design"
  description="Two decades of design and development for startups, agencies, and enterprise teams. Savelle McThias, designer and developer in Scottsdale, Arizona."
>
  <!-- Interactive dot grid backdrop (src/scripts/dot-grid.ts): fixed,
       behind the hero section below (its bg-zinc-950 is dropped so it
       shows through; body's own bg-zinc-950 is the fallback before JS
       draws anything). Fades out as the footer (#contact) scrolls into view. pointer-events-none so it never intercepts clicks —
       mouse position is read via a window-level listener instead. -->
  <canvas id="dot-grid-canvas" data-fade-trigger="#contact" class="fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <!-- ── Hero: headline, line-art portrait, three paragraphs ──────────── -->
  <section class="relative pt-16 md:pt-28 pb-16 md:pb-24">
    <div class="px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12">
      <h1 data-word-reveal class="font-head text-mega md:text-9xl font-normal text-zinc-50">
        When you work with me, you work with me.
      </h1>
      <div class="mt-12 md:mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="min-w-0 lg:col-span-5 order-2 lg:order-1">
          <img
            src={`${base}/images/about/savelle.svg`}
            alt="Line-art portrait of Savelle McThias"
            class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="min-w-0 lg:col-span-5 order-1 lg:order-2">
          <p data-word-reveal data-word-reveal-speed="fast" class="text-lg md:text-3xl text-zinc-50 text-normal">
            No account managers, no juniors, no handoffs.
          </p>
          <p data-word-reveal data-word-reveal-speed="fast" class="text-lg md:text-3xl text-zinc-50 text-normal mt-6">
            I design websites, brands and emails, and I build them too. One person from first sketch to launch, so nothing gets lost along the way.
          </p>
          <p data-word-reveal data-word-reveal-speed="fast" class="text-lg md:text-3xl text-zinc-50 text-normal mt-6">
            Design has to reach people. That’s the whole job. If it doesn’t connect with the people it’s meant for, it doesn’t matter how good it looks.
          </p>
          <p data-word-reveal data-word-reveal-speed="fast" class="text-lg md:text-3xl text-zinc-50 text-normal mt-6">
            I use AI every day. It helps me try more ideas. The taste and the final call are mine.
          </p>
          <p data-word-reveal data-word-reveal-speed="fast" class="text-lg md:text-3xl text-zinc-50 text-normal mt-6">
            Eighteen years in. Agencies, startups, big marketing teams, and on my own since 2021.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Connect: LinkedIn (small) + Substack (large) ─────────────────── -->
  <section class="relative pb-24 md:pb-36">
    <div class="px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div data-image-reveal data-image-reveal-duration="1" class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col justify-between gap-10 rounded-3xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 p-8 md:p-10">
        <div>
          <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 font-head text-big font-normal text-zinc-50"><svg class="w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.937 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 4.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z" /></svg>LinkedIn</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg md:text-xl text-zinc-300">Connect with me.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/savelle/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          data-jelly
          class="jelly self-start inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white text-zinc-950 text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-colors cursor-pointer"
        >
          Connect
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 17L17 7M8 7h9v9" /></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div data-image-reveal data-image-reveal-duration="1" data-image-reveal-delay="0.15" class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-10 rounded-3xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 p-8 md:p-12">
        <div>
          <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 font-head text-big font-normal text-zinc-50"><svg class="w-7 h-7 md:w-9 md:h-9 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22.539 8.242H1.46V5.406h21.08v2.836zM1.46 10.812V24L12 18.11 22.54 24V10.812H1.46zM22.54 0H1.46v2.836h21.08V0z" /></svg>Follow along on Substack</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg md:text-xl text-zinc-300 max-w-xl">Where I write about design and how to get more out of it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 md:gap-10">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-head text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-zinc-50">Better design from AI</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base text-zinc-300">How to write prompts that speak to your customers and stay on brand. How to judge what comes back. How to give feedback so it stops looking like every other AI design.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-head text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-zinc-50">Working with designers</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base text-zinc-300">What I wish every client knew before we start. What to bring, what to have ready, and how to get the best from the person you hire.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-head text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-zinc-50">Stories from the work</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base text-zinc-300">Projects I’ve taken on and what each one taught me.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://savelledesign.substack.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          data-jelly
          class="jelly self-start inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white text-zinc-950 text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-colors cursor-pointer"
        >
          Read on Substack
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 17L17 7M8 7h9v9" /></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
